==Trivia== 
* The term Avernic refers to a race of [[demon]]s, which are composed of the Tsutsaroth (demons such as [[K'ril Tsutsaroth]] and [[Porazdir]]), Alyaroth ([[greater demon]]s and [[black demon]]s) and Byzroth ([[lesser demon]]s) tribes.
**In ''Old School RuneScape'', [[Thammaron]] is the only demon directly confirmed to be Avernic.{{CiteNPC|npc=Golem (Desert Treasure II)|quote=Thammaron {{*}} Designation: Foe {{*}} Race: Avernic {{*}} Rank: Legatus (Formerly) {{*}} Status: Alive {{*}} Last Known Location: Kharyrll {{*}} Notes: None.|loc=Desert Treasure II - The Fallen Empire}}
*The root word ''Avernus'' refers to an ancient Roman gateway to the underworld.

